data: {"id": "45bf4d9febf945ad-thinking-parallel_evidence-750", "run_id": "45bf4d9febf945ad", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我看到了关键信息：\n\n**关键事实：**\n1. Pod 的 Node-Selector 是：`aiops.lab/unavailable=true`\n2. 集群有 3 个节点：master、node1、node2，全部 Ready\n3. 3 个节点的标签中**都没有** `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 这个标签\n\n让我验证一下节点上到底有没有这个标签：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788404878727, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

