data: {"id": "45bf4d9febf945ad-final", "run_id": "45bf4d9febf945ad", "seq": 2097, "ts_ms": 1788404917921, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh 处于 Pending 状态，未被调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` (fact-0f65e68ba8b2) | `Warning FailedScheduling 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Preemption is not helpful for scheduling.` | 直接显示调度器在集群所有节点上均因亲和性/选择器不匹配而拒绝调度，且无抢占空间。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubernetes` (fact-059cbbee294c) | Pod 状态为 `Pending` | 确认 Pod 始终无法进入运行状态，是调度过失败的直接表现。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` (fact-4a87effbe42f, fact-79b485bdb988) | `resource_request`: Memory `8Mi`, CPU `5m`; `resource_limit`: Memory `32Mi`, CPU `50m` | 资源请求极其微小，排除因资源配额不足导致的调度阻塞。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` (fact-051645be8718) | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}` 值为 `1` | 确认当前 Pod 确实处于 Pending 阶段，无状态切换。 |\n\n**证据分析：**\n1. Pod 的 Pending 状态（#2）与 Prometheus 指标持续为 Pending（#4）相互印证，排除了状态抖动可能。\n2. 调度事件明确指出了拒绝原因是 `node affinity/selector` 不匹配（#1），而非资源不足。\n3. 极低的资源请求配置（#3）进一步证实了调度失败并非由资源争抢引起，而是纯粹的配置匹配问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 包含 Node-Selector `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` → 集群节点标签中不存在 `aiops.lab/unavailable` → 调度器过滤全部节点，返回 FailedScheduling 事件 → Pod 持续保持 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod 调度约束（Node-Selector）与集群节点标签不匹配**。\n调度器根据 Pod 的 Node-Selector `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 进行过滤，但集群中所有节点均缺乏该标签，导致调度失败（见证据 #1）。Pod 的 Pending 状态（见证据 #2）是该机制的唯一可观测现象。资源请求极低（见证据 #3）排除了资源瓶颈。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 53.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 53.1s (Evidence 45.1s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 85.451, "metrics": {"run_id": "45bf4d9febf945ad", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 85.44718050956726, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 85447.18050956726, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 78113.39378356934, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 18074.347257614136, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6823.724031448364}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 23289.289474487305, "s